#ASSERT `the occurrence is an accident` (`(ba) orally ingesting something on a specific occasion` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the occurrence is an accident` (`(c) a burn or exposure to radiation on a specific occasion` TRUE)
#ASSERT `the occurrence is an accident` (`(d) absorbing a chemical through the skin` 30)
#ASSERT NOT `the occurrence is an accident` (`(d) absorbing a chemical through the skin` 31)
#ASSERT `the occurrence is an accident` (`(e) exposure to the elements or extremes of temperature` 20 31 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the occurrence is an accident` (`(e) exposure to the elements or extremes of temperature` 20 30 FALSE)
