§§ `Goal 1 — classification and the Account`

#ASSERT `a motor vehicle injury` `the movement of a motor vehicle`
#ASSERT NOT `a motor vehicle injury` `loading, unloading, repairing or servicing a vehicle`
-- s 29(2): a vehicle injury at the workplace is a motor vehicle injury
#ASSERT `the class of injury, treatment injury:` FALSE `, for a work injury:` FALSE `, at work:` `at a place for the purposes of employment` `, vehicle:` `the movement of a motor vehicle` `, work gradual process:` FALSE EQUALS `a motor vehicle injury`
